Mythic Upgrades for Horizon 26.3 (version 0.2.0)

A port of Mythic Upgrades 5.1.1 (Fabric, Minecraft 1.20.1) by TriQue (fabric.mod.json "authors", gradle.properties
mod_author).
Original source: https://github.com/TriQue06/mythic-upgrades-multiloader (branch 1.20.1, version=5.1.1)
Original licence: MIT ("license": "MIT" in fabric.mod.json, license=MIT in gradle.properties). The 1.20.1 branch
ships no licence file; LICENSE is the MIT text from the author's earlier repository,
https://github.com/TriQue06/mythic-upgrades-1.20.x (its copyright line names no holder; the author is TriQue).

Ported to Horizon by lavoide: the rules (budding crystal growth, ore experience, the armour set effects, the tool
effects, the end city loot) are re-implemented in Rust on Horizon's mod API, and the content (blocks, items,
textures, models, sounds, loot, recipes, tags, trims, worldgen) is carried over from the original jar and converted
to 26.3's formats. This port is distributed under the same licence as the original (MIT); the licence text is in
LICENSE. Built against Horizon's exact-build SDK dd67b76ff23e28c6d8e21859df600d31572f81a0.
